OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty over fatal
OL,4,Adog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded not guilty after a
OL,7,Fwoman died in a dog attack in
OL,8,FWolverhampton.
OL,10,FLila Hall, 78, was attacked on Willis
OL,11,FPearson Avenue in Bilston on 15 April
OL,12,Fand died at the scene.
OL,14,FMatthew Williams, 37, from
OL,15,FWolverhampton, pleaded not guilty to
OL,16,Fbeing the owner/person in charge of a
OL,17,Fdog dangerously out of control causing
OL,18,Finjury, resulting in the death of a
OL,19,Fperson, at Wolverhampton Crown Court on
OL,20,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
